# Actions scans found were never committed anywhere; see the scan_chain.yml
# build report (2026-07-25) for the full diagnosis. Un-ignored so
# .github/workflows/scan_chain.yml's collect job can actually commit it via
# code/vdw_reach_commit.py. Flagged explicitly for review -- this is a
# policy change to a file that was previously treated as disposable.
